# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the release gate (ci/gate.sh).
# libomp is not built with TSan: a worker's nested parallel region has
# libomp initialise and lock its own mutexes on threads it starts, which
# TSan reports as races inside libomp (pthread_mutex_init against
# pthread_mutex_lock, both called from libomp.so). 4.4.0 reports the same
# two. Only races whose stack is inside libomp are suppressed.
race:libomp.so
